  "description": "Growing old together was the plan. Dying together? That part’s improvised. | Kicking the Bucket is an immersive fiction dramedy about love, aging, and winging it at the end of life. Dolores and Howard have decided to die with dignity, but they’re not exactly sure how. This darkly funny multicast series explores elder care, autonomy, caregiving, and the awkward, tender moments in between. | Created by award-winning artist Andee Kinzy, Kicking the Bucket blends humor and heartbreak, building to a choose-your-own-ending finale. | Content warning: Alzheimer’s, cancer, and end-of-life decision-making. | More + full credits at improvedarts.org/kickingthebucketpodcast | This project is supported in part by the City of Austin Economic Development Department. ImprovEd Arts is a sponsored project of Austin Creative Alliance.",
